WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.490
Recall is a very high
bar to actually meet,

00:00:02.490 --> 00:00:04.580
and the reason I think you
saw so many Californians is

00:00:04.580 --> 00:00:06.220
because there's a real sense of urgency.

00:00:06.220 --> 00:00:08.280
We want change now.
There's a connection

00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:09.790
between what's going on in Sacramento

00:00:09.790 --> 00:00:10.950
and the rising cost of living.

00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:12.940
There's a connection between
what's going on in Sacramento

00:00:12.940 --> 00:00:14.199
and the fact that people
are leaving California

00:00:14.199 --> 00:00:15.032
for their first time.

00:00:15.032 --> 00:00:17.110
The recall sent a very clear warning

00:00:17.110 --> 00:00:17.983
to the rest of the nation

00:00:17.983 --> 00:00:20.380
that California is not
a model for the nation.

00:00:20.380 --> 00:00:23.720
It is a warning about the
perils of a corrupt government.

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:26.323
Those that think this thing is not close,

00:00:27.190 --> 00:00:29.213
I hate to disabuse you, it is.

00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:33.190
California Governor Gavin
Newsom is in trouble

00:00:33.190 --> 00:00:34.260
and he knows it.

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:37.000
Newsom, who's facing a recall
vote on September 14th,

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:39.180
told the editorial board
of the Sacramento Bee

00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:41.900
that his fellow Democrats
have been far too complacent

00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:43.380
about the risk that he faces

00:00:43.380 --> 00:00:46.180
and how damaging his loss
would be to the national party.

00:00:46.180 --> 00:00:49.800
In Nancy Pelosi state, in Kamala Harris',

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:53.320
with California and the values we profess,

00:00:53.320 --> 00:00:55.675
would be judged in a different light.

00:00:55.675 --> 00:00:57.370
If this was a successful recall,

00:00:57.370 --> 00:01:00.950
I think it would have
profound consequences.

00:01:00.950 --> 00:01:02.550
Newsom's concerns are well-founded,

00:01:02.550 --> 00:01:04.010
according to recent polls.

00:01:04.010 --> 00:01:05.890
Because of COVID, the state has mailed

00:01:05.890 --> 00:01:08.030
every eligible California voter a ballot

00:01:08.030 --> 00:01:09.280
with two questions on it,

00:01:09.280 --> 00:01:11.950
shall Gavin Newsom be recalled
from the office of Governor

00:01:11.950 --> 00:01:14.440
and which of these 46
candidates should replace him,

00:01:14.440 --> 00:01:15.730
if that were to happen?

00:01:15.730 --> 00:01:18.147
If the recall succeeds,
whichever candidate receives

00:01:18.147 --> 00:01:21.060
the plurality of votes will replace Newsom

00:01:21.060 --> 00:01:24.010
until the next governor's race in 2022.

00:01:24.010 --> 00:01:26.690
Newsom and his Democratic allies
have portrayed the election

00:01:26.690 --> 00:01:29.980
as a right-wing plot to take
over California's government.

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:31.990
Who's behind the partisan recall

00:01:31.990 --> 00:01:33.570
of Governor Gavin Newsom?

00:01:33.570 --> 00:01:36.040
Anti-vaccine QAnon extremists,

00:01:36.040 --> 00:01:38.430
violent white supremacists,
like the Proud Boys

00:01:38.430 --> 00:01:41.240
who attacked our nation's
Capitol on January 6th,

00:01:41.240 --> 00:01:43.830
and the same right-wing
Republican politicians

00:01:43.830 --> 00:01:45.480
who supported Donald Trump's attempt

00:01:45.480 --> 00:01:46.813
to overturn the election.

00:01:48.770 --> 00:01:51.240
But what's actually
animating recall voters are

00:01:51.240 --> 00:01:53.050
issues like rising homelessness,

00:01:53.050 --> 00:01:55.990
high housing and energy
costs, fear of rising crime,

00:01:55.990 --> 00:01:58.570
and COVID policies that have
little basis in science,

00:01:58.570 --> 00:02:00.790
like closing beaches,
banning outdoor dining,

00:02:00.790 --> 00:02:03.060
and keeping in-person
public schools shut longer

00:02:03.060 --> 00:02:04.210
than any other state.

00:02:04.210 --> 00:02:06.650
The recall should be as big a wake-up call

00:02:06.650 --> 00:02:08.600
to the Democratic political establishment

00:02:08.600 --> 00:02:10.190
as the population exodus

00:02:10.190 --> 00:02:13.330
that recently caused California
to lose a congressional seat

00:02:13.330 --> 00:02:15.086
for the first time in its history.

00:02:15.086 --> 00:02:16.600
Everyone loves you.

00:02:16.600 --> 00:02:19.420
Everyone is talking about
how you've handled this.

00:02:19.420 --> 00:02:20.550
Early in the pandemic,

00:02:20.550 --> 00:02:23.840
Newsom was second only to New
York Governor Andrew Cuomo

00:02:23.840 --> 00:02:26.810
in the adoration he received
from celebrities and the media

00:02:26.810 --> 00:02:28.260
for his COVID response.

00:02:28.260 --> 00:02:30.860
One of the governors who acted earliest,

00:02:30.860 --> 00:02:32.130
with regards to the coronavirus.

00:02:32.130 --> 00:02:33.560
You've been getting a lot of praise

00:02:33.560 --> 00:02:34.950
for shutting things down.

00:02:34.950 --> 00:02:36.580
The pandemic briefly turned Newsom

00:02:36.580 --> 00:02:39.090
into a national hero,
and he touted California

00:02:39.090 --> 00:02:40.210
as a global beacon.

00:02:40.210 --> 00:02:42.910
Absolutely, we see this as an opportunity

00:02:42.910 --> 00:02:47.470
to reshape the way we do
business and how we govern.

00:02:47.470 --> 00:02:49.300
And as a model of progressive governance

00:02:49.300 --> 00:02:52.350
that he claimed would change
American politics forever.

00:02:52.350 --> 00:02:54.610
What's the opportunity, to your question,

00:02:54.610 --> 00:02:56.990
for re-imagining a more progressive era,

00:02:56.990 --> 00:02:58.920
as it relates to capitalism?

00:02:58.920 --> 00:03:00.740
But as flattening the curve morphed

00:03:00.740 --> 00:03:02.420
into indefinite lockdowns?

00:03:02.420 --> 00:03:04.020
The schools should be closed.

00:03:04.020 --> 00:03:05.490
The schools will be closed.

00:03:05.490 --> 00:03:07.550
[Correspondent 1] He says
a return to life as normal

00:03:07.550 --> 00:03:10.090
in that state will not
happen any time soon.

00:03:10.090 --> 00:03:12.030
We are committed to a process,

00:03:12.030 --> 00:03:15.440
we've socialized that process,
and we are leaning in.

00:03:15.440 --> 00:03:17.650
And the case rates surged regardless.

00:03:17.650 --> 00:03:19.100
With California announcing

00:03:19.100 --> 00:03:21.800
a record 71 deaths in one day.

00:03:21.800 --> 00:03:24.440
Newsom acted as if, for him, the rules

00:03:24.440 --> 00:03:26.700
that were paralyzing
the state's restaurant

00:03:26.700 --> 00:03:28.780
and nightlife scene didn't apply.

00:03:28.780 --> 00:03:31.070
While Governor Newsom is telling all of us

00:03:31.070 --> 00:03:33.770
to have Thanksgiving dinner outside,

00:03:33.770 --> 00:03:35.810
he's facing some new fallout

00:03:35.810 --> 00:03:38.120
for that fancy birthday dinner party

00:03:38.120 --> 00:03:40.550
he went to at The French Laundry.

00:03:40.550 --> 00:03:43.670
He's implemented rules that
we would gladly follow,

00:03:43.670 --> 00:03:46.290
but I don't think he's
setting the best example.

00:03:46.290 --> 00:03:48.170
I think it's highly hypocritical of him.

00:03:48.170 --> 00:03:50.140
The petition to recall surpassed

00:03:50.140 --> 00:03:52.350
the required one and a
half million signature mark

00:03:52.350 --> 00:03:55.920
in February 2021 and officially
made the ballot in July.

00:03:55.920 --> 00:03:59.760
If Gavin Newsom were an
employee in my corporation,

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:03.240
I would have fired him
a long damn time ago.

00:04:03.240 --> 00:04:04.170
For Orrin Heatlie,

00:04:04.170 --> 00:04:06.340
the retired Yolo County Sheriff Sergeant

00:04:06.340 --> 00:04:09.600
who started the recall petition
six months before COVID hit,

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:12.036
illegal immigration was
a motivating factor.

00:04:12.036 --> 00:04:15.530
His open border policy,
giving our tax money

00:04:15.530 --> 00:04:18.810
to illegal immigrants for
housing, food, and clothing

00:04:18.810 --> 00:04:21.140
when our own citizens are on the street,

00:04:21.140 --> 00:04:23.430
our own veterans are
homeless on the street.

00:04:23.430 --> 00:04:25.790
Newsom, in turn, has pointed to his role

00:04:25.790 --> 00:04:28.050
as evidence that the
recall effort is a plot

00:04:28.050 --> 00:04:30.930
by right-wing extremists,
pointing to substantial funding

00:04:30.930 --> 00:04:33.630
from the California GOP
and Mike Huckabee's PAC,

00:04:33.630 --> 00:04:35.520
and highlighting in particular comments

00:04:35.520 --> 00:04:37.450
that Heatlie posted to Facebook

00:04:37.450 --> 00:04:40.280
that called for microchipping
illegal immigrants.

00:04:40.280 --> 00:04:43.620
People keep going back to
this Facebook comment you made

00:04:43.620 --> 00:04:47.660
about tagging illegal
immigrants like herd animals.

00:04:47.660 --> 00:04:50.860
Absolutely against mandatory
chipping of anybody.

00:04:50.860 --> 00:04:55.120
That was a statement made in hyperbole

00:04:55.120 --> 00:04:56.840
to generate conversation,

00:04:56.840 --> 00:04:59.760
and yeah, it was not well-worded

00:04:59.760 --> 00:05:03.583
and not the right thing to put out there.

